{"id":"healthy-saturation","why":"the shape §8 predicts: growth per turn falls week over week while superseded+review keeps climbing — the store stops growing because facts get resolved, not because work stopped","samples":[{"ts":"2026-01-05","live":12,"superseded":0,"review":0,"turns":20,"injected":30,"used":6},{"ts":"2026-01-12","live":26,"superseded":2,"review":1,"turns":55,"injected":95,"used":26},{"ts":"2026-01-19","live":33,"superseded":7,"review":3,"turns":95,"injected":180,"used":62},{"ts":"2026-01-26","live":36,"superseded":14,"review":5,"turns":140,"injected":270,"used":103},{"ts":"2026-02-02","live":37,"superseded":22,"review":6,"turns":190,"injected":370,"used":150}],"audit":[{"ts":"2026-01-06","op":"reconcile","verdict":"contradict"},{"ts":"2026-01-13","op":"reconcile","verdict":"contradict"},{"ts":"2026-01-14","op":"supersede"},{"ts":"2026-01-15","op":"reconcile","verdict":"same"},{"ts":"2026-01-20","op":"reconcile","verdict":"contradict"},{"ts":"2026-01-21","op":"supersede"},{"ts":"2026-01-22","op":"reconcile","verdict":"contradict"},{"ts":"2026-01-28","op":"supersede"},{"ts":"2026-02-03","op":"reconcile","verdict":"refine"}],"expect":{"weeks":[1,2,3,4,5],"flattening":true,"flattening_tail":3,"use_ratio_min":0.35,"contradictions":[[1,1],[2,2],[3,3],[4,1]]}}
{"id":"runaway-growth","why":"live facts keep piling on at a constant rate with nothing ever superseded — the pre-redesign failure mode, and the one metric 1 exists to catch. Flat-looking totals must NOT be read as saturation here","samples":[{"ts":"2026-01-05","live":20,"superseded":0,"review":0,"turns":20,"injected":40,"used":6},{"ts":"2026-01-12","live":60,"superseded":0,"review":0,"turns":60,"injected":120,"used":16},{"ts":"2026-01-19","live":100,"superseded":0,"review":0,"turns":100,"injected":200,"used":26},{"ts":"2026-01-26","live":140,"superseded":0,"review":0,"turns":140,"injected":280,"used":36}],"audit":[],"expect":{"weeks":[1,2,3,4],"flattening":false,"flattening_tail":3,"use_ratio_max":0.35,"contradictions":[]}}
{"id":"dormant-store","why":"growth per turn does fall, but nothing is being resolved either — a store nobody writes to. Reporting this as saturation would be the single most misleading thing the metric could say, so both halves are required","samples":[{"ts":"2026-01-05","live":30,"superseded":1,"review":0,"turns":40,"injected":60,"used":25},{"ts":"2026-01-12","live":31,"superseded":1,"review":0,"turns":120,"injected":150,"used":60},{"ts":"2026-01-19","live":31,"superseded":1,"review":0,"turns":220,"injected":260,"used":100},{"ts":"2026-01-26","live":32,"superseded":1,"review":0,"turns":330,"injected":380,"used":140}],"audit":[{"ts":"2026-01-07","op":"supersede"}],"expect":{"weeks":[1,2,3,4],"flattening":false,"flattening_tail":3,"use_ratio_min":0.35,"contradictions":[[1,1]]}}
{"id":"gap-weeks-are-not-invented","why":"two weeks of use, then an 18-day silence, then more use. The silent weeks must be ABSENT from the series, not zero-filled: a fabricated flat week is indistinguishable from real saturation and would let a vacation prove the design works. The shape here would otherwise read as flattening, so this also pins the second rule — a 3-week trend asked of 2 weeks of data is unanswerable, not true","samples":[{"ts":"2026-03-02","live":10,"superseded":0,"review":0,"turns":15,"injected":20,"used":5},{"ts":"2026-03-05","live":18,"superseded":1,"review":0,"turns":40,"injected":70,"used":24},{"ts":"2026-03-30","live":24,"superseded":6,"review":2,"turns":90,"injected":160,"used":70}],"audit":[],"expect":{"weeks":[1,5],"flattening":false,"flattening_tail":3,"contradictions":[]}}
{"id":"recall-precision-below-bar","why":"the store is saturating nicely but recall keeps injecting facts nothing uses — 0.12 against a 0.35 bar. Metric 2 has to be able to fail while metric 1 passes, or a store that looks healthy hides a useless relevance gate","samples":[{"ts":"2026-04-06","live":18,"superseded":0,"review":0,"turns":30,"injected":120,"used":12},{"ts":"2026-04-13","live":30,"superseded":3,"review":1,"turns":80,"injected":330,"used":38},{"ts":"2026-04-20","live":35,"superseded":9,"review":2,"turns":140,"injected":600,"used":70},{"ts":"2026-04-27","live":37,"superseded":16,"review":4,"turns":205,"injected":900,"used":105}],"audit":[],"expect":{"weeks":[1,2,3,4],"flattening":true,"flattening_tail":3,"use_ratio_max":0.35,"contradictions":[]}}
{"id":"contradictions-peak-then-fall","why":"§8's third claim: conflicts spike in weeks 2–4 as the store meets reality, then fall as it settles. Declined verdicts count — the claim is about what the system NOTICES, and a conflict a human still has to confirm was noticed all the same","samples":[{"ts":"2026-05-04","live":15,"superseded":0,"review":0,"turns":25,"injected":50,"used":20},{"ts":"2026-05-11","live":24,"superseded":4,"review":1,"turns":70,"injected":140,"used":55},{"ts":"2026-05-18","live":28,"superseded":11,"review":3,"turns":120,"injected":240,"used":95},{"ts":"2026-05-25","live":30,"superseded":17,"review":4,"turns":175,"injected":350,"used":140},{"ts":"2026-06-01","live":31,"superseded":19,"review":4,"turns":230,"injected":460,"used":185}],"audit":[{"ts":"2026-05-05","op":"reconcile","verdict":"contradict"},{"ts":"2026-05-12","op":"reconcile","verdict":"contradict"},{"ts":"2026-05-13","op":"reconcile","verdict":"contradict"},{"ts":"2026-05-14","op":"supersede"},{"ts":"2026-05-19","op":"reconcile","verdict":"contradict"},{"ts":"2026-05-20","op":"reconcile","verdict":"contradict"},{"ts":"2026-05-21","op":"supersede"},{"ts":"2026-05-22","op":"reconcile","verdict":"contradict"},{"ts":"2026-05-26","op":"reconcile","verdict":"contradict"},{"ts":"2026-05-27","op":"supersede"},{"ts":"2026-06-02","op":"reconcile","verdict":"same"},{"ts":"2026-06-03","op":"reconcile","verdict":"refine"}],"expect":{"weeks":[1,2,3,4,5],"flattening":true,"flattening_tail":3,"contradictions":[[1,1],[2,3],[3,4],[4,2]],"contradictions_peak_week":3}}
